<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta has extended cross-border airstrikes, bombing a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while Thai officials responded diplomatically after Thai nationals were injured. Russian operators are piloting drones for the junta on Myanmar front lines, and the United States is linking diplomatic engagement on Myanmar peace talks to access to the country's rare-earth resources. Airstrikes have hit civilian sites in Myanmar, killing children at a school and at a girls' dormitory in Karen State. The International Court of Justice will deliver its judgment on the Rohingya genocide case on 19 November. 2,332 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQQkxmQTd3VU15TVRnZk5qWUUxRVVzNUlPd1h4a2M3VWItR3hEWTdCbHRjaDZVaHNZUWVPT3FJT1o3UmxVYS1ST0dPX2pfaS1RYW85M2NpRm1DQkVVbnBtbFdaOF9UMWxjeVdnWXh1OGRRWHFlazJhbWhlRG1MZWd3d3RvOVBlSWt1X3E1bHhneWVoMGRQRzFxMEZPdEtoSDk1UEY4OTA0UjYzTV9YRW1QLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQektPMXRENjNVbGZYbW9uOE5TdHFnWkxqTWh0bmJqLWtFUnBMQ2xSM2s2am5ra3NLdEhBMFFhYTRYd29ENUx6eDI3YjBURW1BcW5jZ0RBSkowbEplM0lwY251UzZuWEZmZng0RGVvbkYxV090RTJlaVZvUkx5LWR1aFdfYWFTbmN2T05LbmRHOGhmOW5Cci1fSW96UjMxNDFuLThmMVo4V00teDd0a2Zr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPaUNVZUtWQzFoS0NCZ0JtSjZyS1NxVEppb0o5Z0JUMEdtUmNfZDlrQWtELUNkYlZtaXVOZm9fRUxBUkJ0dTIwQ1dMcUFielNhcUd0cDBpV1lrMHN5LXFZcFFYOXpta21mcVlWU1VXbDZuMG9nV1NXS3RDMGtScjRSdEkwdDhadGdzMW9lTDBub3JCSm01OWh6X0ZB?oc=5&quot;&gt